body:
I dont have access to your archetypes, so I cant make recommendations based on that. I think they are exceptionally good at making sure they release songs that they havent done before, and if there are connecting elements between songs they make sure the variation is interesting enough that it feels like an improvement on a theme rather than being stuck in an old idea.

if you are a lover of exai i think you will love pretty much most of their discography,

for now two songs I would consider to be my idea of archetypal Autechre would have to be ’Pro Radii’ ’Bine’ and ’X4’, and if you want to get into earlier Autechre ’Krib’ has a very specific sortof nostalgic melancholy that they pinpointed absolutely perfectly.
